Playwright Incremental- Best Practices
1. Coding Standards
•	Use camelCase for methods and variables. 
o	Example: clickOnSearchBar()
•	Use UPPERCASE for locators. 
o	Example: SEARCH_BAR
•	Use Pascal for Class Name. 
o	Example: HomePage
•	Use meaningful names for files, folders, classes, methods, and variables.
2. Exception Handling
•	Every function must contain a try-catch block.
•	Try Block: 
o	logger.info()
o	runReport.record()
o	Execution of the action
o	Verification of the action result
•	Catch Block: 
o	logger.error()
o	runReport.record()
o	Screenshot.capture()
o	Re-throw the exception
3. Logging and Reporting
•	Log the start and completion of every action.
•	Capture all failures in reports.
•	Maintain timestamp-based logs for easy debugging.
4. Function Documentation
Every method must have proper JSDoc comments.
TypeScript
/**
* Author: 
* Method Name: 
* Description:
* Parameters: 
* Return Type: 
