5. Framework Utilities
Create reusable utility classes for:
•	Logger
•	Screenshot
•	Report
•	WebDriver Helper

8. Verification Standards
•	Every user action must be followed by a verification step.
•	Examples: 
o	Click → Verify navigation/visibility.
o	Enter Text → Verify entered value.
o	Submit Form → Verify success message.
